CONTROLS

views---
F1: internal view
F2: another internal view
F3: fixed camera view (from last helicopter position)
F4: helicopter view
F5: common view (something Micro Machines-like)
F9: toggle split screen
F10: toggle map texture
num pad /: increase helicopter distance
num pad *: decrease helicopter distance
num pad +: increase helicopter/camera height
num pad -: decrease helicopter/camera height
TAB: view next car (upper half in split screen mode)
Q: view next car in lower half screen (split screen only)
1: pull up actual viewed car (upper half)
2: pull up actual viewed car (lower half)
ESC: exit to DOS


car1---
arrows or num pad

car2---
  W
A S D
  Z

car3---
  I
J K L
  M

car4---
  T
F G H
  V

car5---
accelerate: num pad 7
decelerate/reverse accelerate: num pad 9
steer left: num pad 1
steer right: num pad 3
brakes: num pad .



